WEBVTT

00:30.357 --> 00:40.585
The world fell grey A missing piece

00:41.086 --> 00:46.230
A quiet, slow and sad release

00:48.440 --> 00:55.362
A chapter closed A best friend gone Just trying

00:55.722 --> 01:00.103
to find a way to carry

01:02.764 --> 01:11.767
on The days were long, the colors faded A little

01:11.827 --> 01:14.087
lost and worn and jaded

01:18.283 --> 01:23.649
Then you walked in and caught

01:23.909 --> 01:28.494
my eye We leave the dull community college sky

02:13.528 --> 02:17.770
You talk of dreams and taking flight

02:21.031 --> 02:24.912
Of leaving all the dark for light

02:28.334 --> 02:32.315
You say you see the real me there

02:34.856 --> 02:39.318
A kindred soul beyond compare

02:45.078 --> 02:50.582
It feels so fast. It feels so right.

02:53.604 --> 02:59.349
A sudden stop in my dark night.

03:00.950 --> 03:04.133
You fill the void. You bridge the gap. A perfect

03:04.153 --> 03:04.653
escape.

03:15.343 --> 03:20.451
I see a new light in your lonely room

03:22.714 --> 03:26.620
But there's a shadow chasing after you

03:30.103 --> 03:37.007
You see a fast car on an open road I see a heavy,

03:37.047 --> 03:42.871
heavy load

03:43.111 --> 03:47.054
And for the first time in a long, long while

04:07.203 --> 04:12.064
And you're a new light in a lonely room

04:14.685 --> 04:19.425
Chasing away the coming gloom

04:22.106 --> 04:28.847
You're a fast car on an open road Lifting off a

04:28.867 --> 04:29.567
heavy load

04:34.901 --> 04:41.306
And for the first time in a long, long while, a new

04:41.366 --> 04:49.433
life. Oh, my dear brother, please be smart.

04:51.375 --> 04:57.760
This new life's gonna break your heart. It's

04:57.860 --> 05:01.243
gonna break your heart.

